'''Yachikubo Kofun''' (谷地久保古墳) is a [[:en:Kofun|Kofun]] located in [[:en:Shirakawa, Fukushima|Shirakawa, Fukushima]] Motonuma (本沼), Fukushima Prefecture. It is a {{ill|round kofun|ja|円墳|1=Round Kofun|1=Round Kofun|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/round kofun|13=User:Immanuelle/Round Kofun|qq=|comment=enwiki is a redirect}} Historic Site1 as a National Historic Site (part of the [[:en:Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites]]).

