The burial structure consists of a Corridor-Style Stone Chamber opening to the south. The chamber's area are as follows{{Sfn|Shirakawa City Historic Site Pamphlet|2011}}:
* Main Chamber: Length 1.44 meters, width 1.38 meters, height 1.19 meters
