'''Yachikubo Kofun''' (谷地久保古墳) is a {{ill|Kofun|en|Kofun|WD=Q1141225|lt=Kofun|1=Kofun}} located in {{ill|Shirakawa, Fukushima|en|Shirakawa, Fukushima|WD=Q750587|lt=Shirakawa, Fukushima|1=Shirakawa, Fukushima}} Motonuma (本沼), Fukushima Prefecture. It is a {{ill|round kofun|ja|円墳|1=Round Kofun|1=Round Kofun|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/round kofun|13=User:Immanuelle/Round Kofun|comment=enwiki is a redirect}} Historic Site1 as a National Historic Site (part of the {{ill|Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|en|Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|WD=Q11579979|lt=Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|1=Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites}}).

== Overview ==

<div class="thumb tright">
{| class="wikitable" style="background:#ffffff;text-align:center;font-size:85%;"
